OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses lament loss of
OL,4,Agreenhouse 'community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FUsers of a government-funded centre for
OL,7,Fdigital and creative start-ups have
OL,8,Fexpressed disappointment about facility
OL,9,Fpotentially closing or changing hands.
OL,11,FThe States of Guernsey has opened
OL,12,Fexpressions of interests for anyone who
OL,13,Fwould like to take over the running of
OL,14,Fthe Digital Greenhouse.
OL,16,FPeople who used the centre in St Peter
OL,17,FPort said the news came as a shock,
OL,18,Fwith some describing it as a
OL,19,F"game-changer" and a place with a
OL,20,F"great community".
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
