OL,3,GNEWSABusinesses lament loss of
OL,4,Agreenhouse 'community'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Marc Laine, Vice-President of
OL,7,Fthe Committee for Economic Development
OL,8,F- which oversees the facility, said it
OL,9,Fwas the right time for the private and
OL,10,Fvoluntary sector to take it on.
